      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">المُتَأَنِّسُ</span></b>  (assumed tropical:)  <i>The lion;</i> (TS, K;) as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">المُسْتَأْنِسُ</span></b> :
